 = 1000000. <20> <1> PRES-COLD = 1000000. <20> <1> U-OPTION = CONSTANT MODE
 = SHORTCUT SIDE-VAR = COLD \ \ FEEDS FHOT = HOTSRC FCOLD = COLDSRC \ \ 
OUTLETS-HOT HOT-SID = HOTPROD \ \ OUTLETS-COLD COLD-SID = COLDPROD \ \ 
"HEAT-TR-COEF" U = 1. <16> <1> \ ? "EO-CONV-OPTI" ? \ DMO-PARAMS MODE = 
